           barrier detectors stacked together in pairs, with the  F0001  1   14 
           signals form detectors summed directly at the          F0001  1   15 
           preamplifier. Three-mil-thick Mylar foils prevented    F0001  1   16 
           He-3 and alpha particles from reaching the detectors.  F0001  1   17 
